{"id":"20e8f6e9b486343b","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-counting-game-ck.md","title":"计数游戏刻画有限变量计数逻辑","display":"thm-counting-game-ck — 计数游戏刻画有限变量计数逻辑","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-counting-game-ck","aliases":["29-thm-counting-game-ck"],"display":"thm-counting-game-ck — 计数游戏刻画有限变量计数逻辑","depends_on":["[[29-df-counting-game]]","[[29-df-ck]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 12.20 and Exercise 12.21, p.188, DjVu scan 203","source_basis":"陈述与题示已视觉核对；原书将证明留作练习，本条记录独立的有限类型归纳证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-counting-game-ck"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-counting-game-ck</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-counting-game-ck — 计数游戏刻画有限变量计数逻辑"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab516fb5dde9de22\" href=\"?note=ab516fb5dde9de22\" title=\"29-df-counting-game\">29-df-counting-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"587fa3c5f12ce89b\" href=\"?note=587fa3c5f12ce89b\" title=\"29-df-ck\">29-df-ck</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 12.20 and Exercise 12.21, p.188, DjVu scan 203"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"陈述与题示已视觉核对；原书将证明留作练习，本条记录独立的有限类型归纳证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 为非空有限结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_k=\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}\">\\(X_k=\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}\\)</span> 为不同变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\">\\(I\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(p)=I\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(p)=I\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(B)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(B)\\)</span> 为全赋值，并满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in I\\;p(i)=(\\alpha(x_i),\\beta(x_i))\">\\(\\forall i\\in I\\;p(i)=(\\alpha(x_i),\\beta(x_i))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^k_\\tau\">\\(C^k_\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{vars}\">\\(\\operatorname{vars}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}\">\\(\\operatorname{fv}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{qr}_C\">\\(\\mathrm{qr}_C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_C\">\\(\\models_C\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"587fa3c5f12ce89b\" href=\"?note=587fa3c5f12ce89b\" title=\"29-df-ck\">29-df-ck</a> 的固定整数阈值、单排序接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\tau,k,m,I}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\tau,k,m,I}\\)</span> 是下式定义的公式集合；局部赋值之外的值不影响其真值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\tau,k,m,I}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\phi\\in C^k_\\tau\\mid\n\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi)\\subseteq X_k\\land\n\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi)\\subseteq\\{x_i:i\\in I\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\phi)\\leq m\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma_{\\tau,k,m,I}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\phi\\in C^k_\\tau\\mid\n\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi)\\subseteq X_k\\land\n\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi)\\subseteq\\{x_i:i\\in I\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\phi)\\leq m\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W^{A,B}_{C,k,m}(p)\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\phi\\in\\Gamma_{\\tau,k,m,I}\\;\n\\bigl(A\\models_C\\phi[\\alpha]\\leftrightarrow B\\models_C\\phi[\\beta]\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W^{A,B}_{C,k,m}(p)\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\phi\\in\\Gamma_{\\tau,k,m,I}\\;\n\\bigl(A\\models_C\\phi[\\alpha]\\leftrightarrow B\\models_C\\phi[\\beta]\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 12.20 与 Exercise 12.21，印刷页188、扫描页203。已核对陈述及有限性题示；原书未在此给出完整证明。这里按本目录的单排序固定阈值语法重建证明，不将双排序可变量阈值原样混入此接口。</p>\n<p>对轮数归纳。零轮，原子真值一致恰好保证全部无量词式一致。归纳步的正向：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\exists^{\\geq q}x_i)\\psi\">\\((\\exists^{\\geq q}x_i)\\psi\\)</span> 在一侧为真，选取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 个见证作为集合挑战；获胜应答提供另一侧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 个元素，每个均可与一个原见证延续获胜位置，归纳假设使它们满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>。交换两侧得到等价；普通存在量词是阈值一，布尔连接词由结构归纳处理。</p>\n<p>反向：去掉将移动的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 号变量后，在两个有限结构的候选落点上按所有剩余秩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 公式的真值分类型。候选点总数有限，故对每个实现在候选集中的类型，可从区分该类型与其余类型的公式中选有限多个并合取，得到同变量集合、秩至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 的特征式。若任一类型在两侧的实现数不同，取较大计数为阈值，其特征式外加一次计数量词即给出秩至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m+1\">\\(m+1\\)</span> 的区分公式。因而所有类型的实现数相等。对任一集合挑战，回应方可逐类型取相同数目的元素；挑战方随后挑的每一点都有同类型原点可回应，归纳假设给剩余轮数的获胜位置。这个证明只需给定有限结构上实现的类型数有限，无需断言全部整数阈值语法有有限多个公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-counting-game","status":"resolved","id":"ab516fb5dde9de22","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-counting-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ck","status":"resolved","id":"587fa3c5f12ce89b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ck]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ck","status":"resolved","id":"587fa3c5f12ce89b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C^k_\\tau$、$\\operatorname{vars}$、$\\operatorname{fv}$、$\\mathrm{qr}_C$、$\\models_C$ 取 [[29-df-ck]] 的固定整数阈值、单排序接口。$\\Gamma_{\\tau,k,m,I}$ 是下式定义的公式集合；局部赋值之外的值不影响其真值。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"X_k=\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(p)=I","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i\\in I\\;p(i)=(\\alpha(x_i),\\beta(x_i))","display":false},{"tex":"C^k_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{vars}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fv}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{qr}_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\tau,k,m,I}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\tau,k,m,I}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\phi\\in C^k_\\tau\\mid\n\\operatorname{vars}(\\phi)\\subseteq X_k\\land\n\\operatorname{fv}(\\phi)\\subseteq\\{x_i:i\\in I\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{qr}_C(\\phi)\\leq m\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"W^{A,B}_{C,k,m}(p)\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\phi\\in\\Gamma_{\\tau,k,m,I}\\;\n\\bigl(A\\models_C\\phi[\\alpha]\\leftrightarrow B\\models_C\\phi[\\beta]\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"(\\exists^{\\geq q}x_i)\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"m+1","display":false}],"bytes":3108,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-counting-game]]、[[29-df-bijection-game]]、[[29-thm-counting-game-ck]]、[[29-thm-counting-bijection]] — 计数与双射游戏"},{"id":"3f7769b0fc6d1261","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"反向，假设还剩 $m+1$ 轮计数获胜。对选定的卵石 $i$，按剩余秩至多 $m$ 的 $C^k$ 公式划分两侧的候选落点。由 [[29-thm-counting-game-ck]]，当前秩 $m+1$ 等价；其有限类型特征式外加一次计数量词，迫使每一类型在两侧的实现数相等。逐类型配对得域间双射；任意配对更新后仍秩 $m$ 等价，故由游戏刻画和归纳假设成为剩余 $m$ 轮双射胜势。正轮时取全域的计数挑战还保证总域大小相等；零轮不添加该条件。证明的有限类型特征式仅针对两给定结构的有限候选点集合。"},{"id":"2985e9c09cdf49eb","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-177","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-counting-game-ck]]"},{"id":"6de56ec38d538277","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-counting-game-ck|29-thm-counting-game-ck]]"}],"outgoing":["ab516fb5dde9de22","587fa3c5f12ce89b"]}